<title>USA: ADC completes Apex acquisition.</title>
<headline>ADC completes Apex acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>ADC Telecommunications Inc said Monday it completed its acquisition of The Apex Group Inc in a stock-for-stock purchase valued at about $26 million.</p>
<p>The transaction was accounted for as a pooling of interests.</p>
<p>Based in Columbia, Maryland, Apex is a software development and information management company.</p>
<p>ADC said Apex will add software-related services and strengthen ADC's network deployment solutions. In addition, ADC said it expects to benefit from Apex's private network applications.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
